:"Verse 1","text":"October 12 to October 22, I didn't skip a beat"},{"t":30.911,"end":33.252,"section":"Chorus","text":"Push it to main, let the green squares show"},{"t":34.339,"end":36.555,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week's a bar, every day's a note"},{"t":37.768,"end":40.336,"section":"Chorus","text":"844 hits and the loop won't stop"},{"t":41.196,"end":43.237,"section":"Chorus","text":"Build it, ship it, take it from the top"},{"t":44.625,"end":47.782,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Right now I'm deep in upi-Down, NekoDroid and musabaka-result"},{"t":48.054,"end":51.057,"section":"Verse 2","text":"62 repos of my own, mostly JavaScript and TypeScript"},{"t":51.482,"end":54.54,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Last push went to upi-Down, the log is still warm"},{"t":54.911,"end":57.471,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Cut it like an AMV, every frame on time"},{"t":58.339,"end":60.616,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Mix it like a mashup, every verse in rhyme"},{"t":61.768,"end":64.349,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Quiet weeks play soft, busy weeks get loud"},{"t":65.196,"end":67.342,"section":"Verse 2","text":"That's the whole year, played back to the crowd"},{"t":68.625,"end":71.08,"section":"Chorus","text":"Push it to main, let the green squares show"},{"t":72.054,"end":74.284,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week's a bar, every day's a note"},{"t":75.482,"end":78.013,"section":"Chorus","text":"844 hits and the loop won't stop"},{"t":78.911,"end":80.803,"section":"Chorus","text":"Build it, ship it, take it from the top"},{"t":82.339,"end":85.238,"section":"Outro","text":"That was 844 contributions from nishal21"},{"t":85.768,"end":88.57,"section":"Outro","text":"Tomorrow the numbers change, and the song does too"}],"peaks":[0.188,0.213,0.22,0.188,0.146,0.176,0.166,0.327,0.48,0.463,0.439,0.505,0.469,0.359,0.364,0.48,0.433,0.265,0.446,0.541,0.394,0.187,0.279,0.269,0.303,0.179,0.147,0.165,0.166,0.616,0.637,0.469,0.412,0.481,0.513,0.387,0.516,0.715,0.511,0.493,0.573,0.527,0.588,0.41